                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58809e5d-bd40-452c-b598-03cd4c4f5f38",
                                "sense_id": "5378851e-6150-308e-92e9-19663fd81fc3",
                                "text": "Jeśli nie uda im się znaleźć nikogo takiego, starosta wyda informację o braku możliwości zaspokojenia potrzeb kadrowych twojej firmy na lokalnym rynku pracy"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "461d57e2-49f5-4d48-9af2-3a53be52ac1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "33fff8e3-9014-3274-b57c-a4fdcdf2383f",
                        "source_sense_id": "5378851e-6150-308e-92e9-19663fd81fc3",
                        "target_lang_word": "appeasement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "appeasement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                        "entry_id": "5709de90-e65f-3fa0-914b-1354a89bf4a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being appeased; the policy of giving in to demands in order to preserve the peace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe08409d-c116-476c-b63f-2d3757bfd9d1",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "This decision is the end of any attempts at appeasement in our land; the end of urging us to get along with the dictators, the end of compromise with tyranny and the forces of oppression."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "679374a2-b8c9-49d2-a636-954ea1f9d311",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "Senator, Saturday on television, you said that you had always thought that Quemoy and Matsu were unwise places to draw our defense line in the Far East. Would you comment further on that, and also address to this question: couldn't a pull-back from those islands be interpreted as appeasement?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "315fc74e-6d6a-4fd3-8cbd-dea46a9e232b",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "What’s crucial is that the Taiwanese people preserve their individual freedom and the planet does not endure a third world war. The best way for the United States to pursue those goals is by maintaining America’s military support for Taiwan while also maintaining the “one China” framework that for more than four decades has helped keep the peace in one of the most dangerous places on earth.\nHawks will call this appeasement. So be it. Ask them how many American lives they’re willing to risk so the United States can have official diplomatic relations with Taiwan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87b2611a-2fe0-453d-a675-20f022d06383",
                        "source_entry_id": "33fff8e3-9014-3274-b57c-a4fdcdf2383f",
                        "source_sense_id": "5378851e-6150-308e-92e9-19663fd81fc3",
                        "target_lang_word": "fulfilment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fulfilment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fdc467c-7b2e-3948-84d3-3f65e4b782a1",
                                        "entry_id": "98414e19-2fd2-3c54-921b-92dd4b0cc34d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of fulfilling or the state or quality of being fulfilled; consummation; completion; realization."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60f001a8-18e8-48ff-bc77-a5255df34a1e",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdc467c-7b2e-3948-84d3-3f65e4b782a1",
                                                "text": "To achieve fulfilment of one's hopes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99480d37-9ed1-4e70-a86e-9388f538aa6f",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdc467c-7b2e-3948-84d3-3f65e4b782a1",
                                                "text": "Fulfilment of contractual obligations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8dfc1842-8f99-44a1-ae57-b010283b81a6",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdc467c-7b2e-3948-84d3-3f65e4b782a1",
                                                "text": "We have yet to see the fulfilment of his potential."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "221e5d57-7b80-4910-aa83-a002121c726c",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdc467c-7b2e-3948-84d3-3f65e4b782a1",
                                                "text": "Civilisation has imbued man's minds with false ideas of the evil of sex and its fulfilment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3762a95f-54c2-4d73-977e-070696a304f7",
                                                "sense_id": "7fdc467c-7b2e-3948-84d3-3f65e4b782a1",
                                                "text": "In questi casi, la morte non è dunque una fine, ma un compimento."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69bfe345-e992-3c98-8854-6b7af2d1d8f2",
                                        "entry_id": "98414e19-2fd2-3c54-921b-92dd4b0cc34d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of satisfaction obtained from one's aspirations or needs being fulfilled."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e620ce3d-513b-4d0a-9763-c89f349af2eb",
                                                "sense_id": "69bfe345-e992-3c98-8854-6b7af2d1d8f2",
                                                "text": "What brings you fulfilment in life?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "357aff1f-9983-4b78-b604-b2014dd2f352",
                                                "sense_id": "69bfe345-e992-3c98-8854-6b7af2d1d8f2",
                                                "text": "Personal fulfilment comes from having a sense of purpose."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a113f36-f94a-37b3-8356-0c79fab4ea3b",
                                        "entry_id": "98414e19-2fd2-3c54-921b-92dd4b0cc34d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The activities performed once an order is received to fulfill the order; packaging, distributing and shipping goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
